n/audio/voiceline/701080/expedition.ogg"},"실망":{"voiceline":"지휘관 동지는… 말 안 듣는 나쁜 아이야…","voicelink":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fernando2603/AzurLane/main/audio/voiceline/701080/feeling1.ogg"},"낯섦":{"voiceline":"지휘관 동지는 어떻게 이런 단결력 있는 함대를 조직한 거야? 내게 말해 봐~","voicelink":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fernando2603/AzurLane/main/audio/voiceline/701080/feeling2.ogg"},"호감":{"voiceline":"지휘관 동지와 그리먀시 사이가 좋아진 거지? 겉으로는 다가가기 어려워 보이지만, 조금만 시간이 지나면 분명 좋은 관계가 될 수 있을 거야!","voicelink":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fernando2603/AzurLane/main/audio/voiceline/701080/feeling3.ogg"},"기쁨":{"voiceline":"지휘관 동지는 진한 맛이 좋아 아니면 연한 맛이 좋아? 다음에 보르시를 준비할 때, 지휘관의 입맛에 맞춰 보려고!","voicelink":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fernando2603/AzurLane/main/audio/voiceline/701080/feeling4.ogg"},"사랑":{"voiceline":"지휘관 동지, 오늘도 수고했어! 따뜻한 차부터 마시면서 몸을 데워봐! 블리니 더 먹을래? 그 전에——힛, 포옹 먼저 할까!","voicelink":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fernando2603/AzurLane/main/audio/voiceline/701080/feeling5.ogg"},"터치3":{"voiceline":"히히~ 지휘관 동지도 아이들에게 흥미가 있어?","voicelink":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fernando2603/AzurLane/main/audio/voiceline/701080/headtouch.ogg"},"모항귀환":{"voiceline":"블리니를 먹고 전투로 지친 몸을 달래보자! 지휘관 동지는 꿀이 좋아 잼이 좋아?","voicelink":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fernando2603/AzurLane/main/audio/voiceline/701080/home.ogg"},"hp 경고":{"voiceline":"의, 의장에 균열이?!","voicelink":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fernando2603/AzurLane/main/audio/voiceline/701080/hp_warning.ogg"},"로그인":{"voiceline":"와! 지휘관 동지, 빨리 돌아왔네! 음…좀 더 쉬지 않아도 돼?","voicelink":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fernando2603/AzurLane/main/audio/voiceline/701080/login.ogg"},"실패":{"voiceline":"아파… 상대도 이렇게 단결이 되어 있을 줄이야…","voicelink":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fernando2603/AzurLane/main/audio/voiceline/701080/lose.ogg"},"우편":{"voiceline":"우편이 있어~ 좋은 소식이려나?","voicelink":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Fernando2603/AzurLane/main/audio/voiceline/701080/mail.ogg"},"임무":{"voiceline":"간단한 임무부터 시작하자! 나도 도와줄게!","voicelink":"https://raw